classDiagram
    note for CloudClient "internal/cloud.Client 组合六个能力端口；List/Resolve 与所有来源访问都接收 Context。provider 只写调用方私有目标，不拥有 Cache、staging、manifest 或 journal（ADR-016）；Submission.Submit 返回 domain.SubmissionResult（accepted/replayed）"
    class Catalog {
        <<interface>>
        +List(Context) (PowerRefs, error)
        +Resolve(Context, PowerRef) (PowerRef, error)
    }
    class SkillSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadSkill(Context, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    class PluginSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadPlugin(Context, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    class MCPSource {
        <<interface>>
        +GetMCP(Context, PowerRef) (MCPServer, error)
    }
    class AgentSource {
        <<interface>>
        +DownloadAgent(Context, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    class Submission {
        <<interface>>
        +Submit(Context, SubmissionRequest) (SubmissionResult, error)
        +GetSubmission(Context, string) (Submission, error)
        +ListSubmissions(Context, SubmissionListQuery) (SubmissionList, error)
    }
    class CloudClient {
        <<interface: internal/cloud.Client>>
    }
    class SubmissionResult {
        +Outcome SubmissionOutcome
        +SubmissionID string
        +Status SubmissionStatus
        +StatusURL string
    }
    note for SubmissionResult "accepted：StatusURL 非空；replayed：StatusURL 固定为空，用 SubmissionID 生成 apm submission get 提示"
    class SubmissionRequest {
        +Type PowerType
        +Name string
        +Version string
        +Description string
        +Message string
        +ContentType string
        +ContentMD5 string
    }
    class SubmissionListQuery {
        +Status SubmissionStatus
        +Type PowerType
        +Name string
    }
    note for SubmissionListQuery "仅筛选当前 API Key 账号的 active Submission；无 limit、cursor 或时间范围，结果最多 20 条"
    class SubmissionDetail {
        <<domain.Submission>>
        +SubmissionID string
        +Description string
        +Message string
        +Status SubmissionStatus
        +CreatedAt string
        +UpdatedAt string
        +Timeline []SubmissionEvent
    }
    class SubmissionEvent {
        +EventID string
        +EventType string
        +StatusFrom SubmissionStatus
        +StatusTo SubmissionStatus
        +Timestamp string
        +Message string
    }

    CloudClient --|> Catalog
    CloudClient --|> SkillSource
    CloudClient --|> PluginSource
    CloudClient --|> MCPSource
    CloudClient --|> AgentSource
    CloudClient --|> Submission

    class ProviderRegistry {
        <<internal/cloud.ProviderRegistry>>
        +Register(ProviderID, Factory) error
        +Open(ProviderID) (CloudClient, error)
    }
    class CompositionRoot {
        <<cmd/apm.newCloudClient>>
        +newCloudClient() (CloudClient, error)
    }
    class LocalClient {
        <<internal/cloud/local.Client>>
    }
    class RemoteClient {
        <<internal/cloud/remote.Client>>
    }
    class MCPServer {
        +Transport MCPTransport
        +Command string
        +Args []string
        +URL string
        +Validate() error
    }
    class MCPResource {
        +SchemaVersion int
        +Name string
        +Version string
        +Description string
        +Definition MCPServer
        +ValidatePowerRef(PowerRef) error
    }
    note for MCPResource "Local/Remote/Submission 读取完整 v1 MCP.json；content 为完整资源的 JCS JSON，definition 仅在校验身份后返回调用方"
    class CallerPrivateDirectory {
        <<absent or empty physical Skill/Plugin destination>>
    }
    class CallerPrivateAgentFile {
        <<absent agent.yaml destination>>
    }

    CompositionRoot --> ProviderRegistry : Register closures, then Open selected ID
    CompositionRoot --> LocalClient : imports local and registers factory closure
    CompositionRoot --> RemoteClient : imports remote and registers factory closure
    ProviderRegistry --> CloudClient : selects factory and returns Client or error
    LocalClient ..|> CloudClient
    RemoteClient ..|> CloudClient
    SkillSource --> CallerPrivateDirectory : writes verified tree
    PluginSource --> CallerPrivateDirectory : writes apc-plugin.json and skills
    AgentSource --> CallerPrivateAgentFile : writes original YAML bytes
    MCPSource --> MCPResource : decodes full v1 content
    MCPResource *-- MCPServer : Definition
    MCPSource --> MCPServer : returns validated Definition, no file cache
    Submission --> SubmissionRequest : Submit carries Message outside content
    Submission --> SubmissionResult : returns accepted (202) or replayed (200)
    Submission --> SubmissionListQuery : active-only authenticated filter
    Submission --> SubmissionDetail : Get returns complete detail
    SubmissionDetail *-- SubmissionEvent : ordered Timeline

    note for LocalClient "显式绝对 fixture 根；物理复制 skills/plugins/agents，严格解码完整 MCPResource 并校验 PowerRef；拒绝链接、特殊节点、路径逃逸、重叠与非空目标。Submission 三方法对全部类型返回 cloud.ErrSubmissionUnsupported（fail loud），只读无真实工单"
    note for RemoteClient "匿名 APC 资源 HTTP：固定 snapshot 分页、latest/exact metadata、strict JSON、size/MD5、完整 MCPResource、受限 archive、同源 redirect；无 retry/fallback。Submission 使用独立 Bearer 认证请求：list 仅 active status/type/name、最多 20 条且无分页；get 返回 Message 与有序 SubmissionEvent。Submit 严格分流 202 accepted、200 replayed、409 ALREADY_PUBLISHED/RESOURCE_VERSION_CONFLICT；受信目录和跨平台发布保持 fail closed"
